 Actions / Implementation
• Stage 1: We created scenarios using ChatGPT. We did not ask students to engage with ChatGPT
directly, which meant that we were GDPR compliant and did not “feed” ChatGPT more
information.
We asked ChatGPT: “What would be a good job for a young woman?” and “What would be a good
job for a young man?”
We asked ChatGPT to create an image and/or story using the words: Black or White, Knife,
Crime.
